t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pedestal</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"AOE Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AOE Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3 <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">?&#160;?&#160;?</a> Ore</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.26.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 17th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Uncertain Pickaxe</b>, also known as the <b>Corrupt Pickaxe</b>, is a special quest pickaxe obtained by placing 3 pieces of <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">Infused Ink</a> onto the active <a href=\"/wiki/Pedestal\" title=\"Pedestal\">pedestals</a> located around the map. It is the first pickaxe to have a unique ability, which is that it causes small <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a> to grow out of an ore vein when it is hit. The <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a> damage surrounding rocks and produce a continuous \"boo-womp\" sound effect from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SpongeBob_SquarePants\">SpongeBob SquarePants</a>.\n</p><p>It has been observed that for the <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">Infused Ink</a> pieces to work on the pedestals, assuming their length is 1 and width is 2, height must be higher than 2. Regardless if cut to that size or not.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Uncertain Pickaxe takes appearance of a miniature Mysterious Mushroom with a <a href=\"/wiki/Fungiviolet\" title=\"Fungiviolet\">Fungiviolet</a> blade impaled through it, being covered in mycelium. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p><b>Note:</b> As of 1.62.0 the pickaxe's ownership will be automatically assigned to whoever placed the Infused Ink on the 3 pedestals.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> and find the small red trigger located deep within the mine. The trigger can be reached by navigating the hanging boards over the underground lake, best done using a <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a>. Note, however, that there are a few dead ends- the correct path leads to a rusty truss. <b>If the button is nowhere to be seen, this means that a person in your server already toggled the quest; you can then skip that part and go to the next quest.</b><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"379682e32fd05be5f65bb69dbf82293b\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:150px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Registry-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:134px; width:185px; top:7px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Registry.png\" title=\"Registry.png (396 KB)\" style=\"height:134px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Registry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240831103118\" title=\"Registry.png (396 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Trigger for quest in Mike&#039;s Mines\" height=\"148\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Registry.png\" data-image-key=\"Registry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Trigger for quest in Mike&#039;s Mines\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Registry.png (396 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Trigger for quest in Mike&#39;s Mines\" height=\"148\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Registry.png\" data-image-key=\"Registry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Trigger for quest in Mike&#39;s Mines\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Registry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240831103118\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Trigger for quest in Mike's Mines</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:150px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Registry_location-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:148px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Registry_location.png\" title=\"Registry location.png (301 KB)\" style=\"height:148px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/Registry_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240831103412\" title=\"Registry location.png (301 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Way to trigger in new mike&#039;s mines\" height=\"148\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Registry location.png\" data-image-key=\"Registry_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Way to trigger in new mike&#039;s mines\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Registry location.png (301 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Way to trigger in new mike&#39;s mines\" height=\"148\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Registry location.png\" data-image-key=\"Registry_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Way to trigger in new mike&#39;s mines\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/Registry_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240831103412\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Way to trigger in new mike's mines</div></div></div></li>\n<li>Find and refine/forge 3 pieces of <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a>. The pieces should be big enough (approximately 4 studs in volume), or else the pedestal may not register it as a valid step towards completing the Uncertain Pickaxe quest.</li>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> and make a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushroom</a> fire a glowing purple spore at a piece of the refined Inkstone.  If successful, a \"boo-womp\" sound effect will be heard and the refined/forged Ink will transform into <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">Infused Ink</a>. Repeat this process with the remaining 2 pieces of refined/forged <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Ink</a>.</li>\n<li>Place a piece of <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">Infused Ink</a> on each of the three pedestals around the map- in the desert canyon, near <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>, and in the Lost Woods near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>. When the quest is active, these pedestals will have a red ring around them and emit a barely-audible bass humming sound. When Infused Ink is placed on them, they should emit a pink aura and shoot a beam pointing toward the center pedestal.</li>\n<li>If successful, three poof sounds will be heard across the whole server, followed with a louder poof noise. This is the pickaxe spawning. Get to the top of the hill in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> (the area with the poison effect) to claim the Uncertain Pickaxe near the center pedestal. The pedestal is on a rock with spires jutting out of it.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Map_Guide\">Map Guide</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"db4748545b6ca7260cda170c0096d2e0\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:120px; width:185px; top:32.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain.png\" title=\"1st pedestal ashiftinterrain.png (5.61 MB)\" style=\"height:120px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250623155534\" title=\"1st pedestal ashiftinterrain.png (5.61 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"1st pedestal picture\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"1st pedestal ashiftinterrain.png\" data-image-key=\"1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"1st pedestal picture\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"1st pedestal ashiftinterrain.png (5.61 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"1st pedestal picture\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"1st pedestal ashiftinterrain.png\" data-image-key=\"1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"1st pedestal picture\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/1st_pedestal_ashiftinterrain.png/revision/latest/