edesignConcept.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240315211705\" title=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png (1.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Redesign concept art\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png\" data-image-key=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Redesign concept art\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png (1.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Redesign concept art\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png\" data-image-key=\"UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Redesign concept art\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/UPickaxeRedesignConcept.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240315211705\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Redesign concept art</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"UncertainPickaxeOld-webp\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:UncertainPickaxeOld.webp\" title=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp (9 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/UncertainPickaxeOld.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240315211846\" title=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp (9 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Old design\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp\" data-image-key=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old design\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp (9 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Old design\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp\" data-image-key=\"UncertainPickaxeOld.webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old design\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/UncertainPickaxeOld.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240315211846\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old design</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>After 15th of March 2024 the pickaxe got a remodel, making it look more fitting to the theme of a tool made out of fungal infused materials. It was made by community members @mr_peeka_boo, @xphrogx and @aylien who drew the concept, provided feedback and modelled it respectively.</li>\n<li>The words \"Corrupt\", \"Daily\", \"Tupi\" and \"Furpz\" referenced in it's description are actually names of 4 known members of the Typical Developers Discord server; Corrupt, Dailyyy, Tupisupi, and Furpz.</li>\n<li>The concept of this pickaxe heavily resembles the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://refinerycaves.fandom.com/wiki/Spore_Pickaxe\">Spore Pickaxe</a> from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/8726743209/LAST-UPDATE-Refinery-Caves\">Refinery Caves</a>. This is possibly because those who suggested the Uncertain Pickaxe's addition were/are fans of that game.</li>\n<li>It is the first pickaxe that is obtainable via completion of a quest.</li>\n<li>Before being discovered, Daily, Furpz, and Tupisupi were leaving cryptic messages, which have been revealed to be pieces of the item's description. Those messages were \"Daily companion\", \"Furpz wood\" and \"Tupi mastery\".</li>\n<li>The Uncertain Pickaxe is capable of destroying entire ore nodes in a couple of swings due to its special ability.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP lim